0,Macaguaje language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Macaguaje_language,"Macaguaje is classified as Extinct by the UNESCO Atlas of the World's Languages in Danger. Macaguaje (Makabajë) is a nearly extinct Tucanoan language of Colombia. [3][4] ↑ ""ONIC - Makaguaje"". ONIC (in European Spanish). Retrieved 2026-01-19. ↑ Marcelo Andrés Niño Garzón (2024).",Macaguaje,Tucanoan
